                                                "sense_id": "daebfadd-04ac-3b1c-bd8f-a3ad9e9766c1",
                                                "text": "You'll see that when you enlarge a subject to many times its normal size, and then crop the photo so there is nothing in proportion to be recognized, all resemblance to the original can be hidden."
